@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>404 – Kafé Terningkast</PageTitle>

<section class="flex min-h-[60vh] items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-lg">

        <div class="relative mx-auto mb-8 flex h-32 w-32 items-center justify-center">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-2xl"></div>

            <div class="relative flex h-24 w-24 rotate-6 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl
                        border border-cafe-border bg-cafe-surface shadow-xl shadow-black/20">
                <span class="font-mono text-6xl leading-none text-neon" aria-hidden="true">⚄</span>
            </div>

            <span class="absolute right-0 top-3 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-dice-1 shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--color-dice-1)]"></span>
            <span class="absolute bottom-2 left-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-dice-3 shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--color-dice-3)]"></span>
        </div>

        <p class="terminal-label">Uff da — blindvei</p>

        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
            <span class="text-neon">404</span>
        </h1>

        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-cafe-text sm:text-2xl">
            Denne siden ble borte i spillet
        </h2>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-cafe-muted">
            Ruta finnes ikke i hylla vår. Kanskje noen har flyttet brikken –
            eller så har du fulgt et litt for dristig kast.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="/"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-5 py-3
                      text-sm font-semibold text-cafe-bg shadow-lg shadow-accent/20
                      transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-hover">
                <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
                Til forsiden
            </a>

            <a href="/games"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-cafe-border
                      bg-cafe-surface px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cafe-text
                      transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
                <span aria-hidden="true">🎲</span>
                Se spillhylla
            </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-xs text-cafe-muted">
            <span class="text-phosphor-dim">~/kafe-terningkast</span><span class="caret"></span>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>